    "title": "",
    "legend": "Low-grade squamous intraepithelial lesion (anal squamous intraepithelial neoplasia I [AIN I]) is characterized by koilocytosis with hyperchromatic raisinoid nuclei and perinuclear haloes. Dyskeratosis is noted. There are no atypical mitoses.",
